# LeakSanitizer suppressions for bugs in nats.c itself (not natscpp).
#
# nats.c 3.15.0 kvStore_PurgeDeletes (kv.c, the kvWatcher_Next loop) keeps only the delete/purge entries it
# reads and never destroys the others; each leaked entry retains the kvStore, so its connection leaks too.
leak:kvStore_PurgeDeletes
